## Keep the Data Quality activity log visible and actually scrollable
================================================================================

Context: The execution log never showed a scrollbar. Polling started only
after 1.5s, completion hid the progress card, and macOS overlay scrollbars
made an empty 200px well look like a single status line.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/query/css/query-dataquality.css
   Pin #dqExecProgressLog to 6.5–9.5rem with overflow-y auto, stable gutter,
   and a visible webkit thumb.
2. src/front/static/query/js/query-dataquality.js
   Poll immediately; keep the log after success/failure; stop hiding the card.
3. tests/units/front/test_dq_progress_log.py
   Contract for overflow CSS, keepProgress, and immediate tick().

