================================================================================
## Show a live activity log on entity Data Quality Checks
================================================================================

Context: Explorer still showed only "Running data quality checks…" with a
spinner. That popup waited on a single GET /dtwin/nodes/shacl, so the
Knowledge Graph tab log could not appear. Start the entity check as a
TaskManager job, poll log_entries into a scrollable well, and keep the
synchronous GET for MCP and the public API.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/node/NodeShaclService.py
   Optional progress callback; per-shape queries after a DQ snapshot.
2. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/TwinBackgroundTasks.py
   run_node_shacl_task wraps evaluate and completes with the facet payload.
3. src/api/routers/internal/dtwin.py
   POST /dtwin/nodes/shacl/start returns a task_id.
4. src/front/templates/partials/dtwin/_query_shacl_facets_modal.html
   Dedicated #shaclFacetsProgressLog in the popup.
5. src/front/static/query/js/query-shacl-facets.js
   POST start, poll /tasks/{id}, render TaskProgressUI activity log.
6. src/front/static/query/css/query-shacl-facets.css
   6.5–9.5rem overflow-y auto scrollport with a visible thumb.

